    "content": "<div class=\"piece__inside\">\n    <div style=\"color:rgb(201, 54, 79);\">\n        <p>\n            Community<br/>\n            Regrets:\n        </p>\n        <p>\n            Deciduous's <em>Community Area has for now been taken off-line.<br/>\n            This is due to poor security and SPAM-bot registrations, together with very little activity.</em>\n        </p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<lightimg src=\"https://codex-content.s3-us-west-2.amazonaws.com/uploads/images/1510020626766-TN0camo.jpg\" bg=\"rgba(62,62,62,0.95)\" width=\"1255\" height=\"856\" ></lightimg>\n<div class=\"piece__inside\">\n    <p style=\"margin-top:1rem\">\n        Did you unscramble last week's puzzle? Answers below.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n        Its future seems sunny / <br/>\n        Stay together family fish / <br/>\n        My heart is easy /\n    </p>\n</div>",
